    "name": "Node Boilerplate API",
    "description": "Postman collection covering the boilerplate service mounted under `/${SERVICE_NAME}/${DEFAULT_API_PREFIX}`. It includes sample payloads that satisfy the DTO validation rules documented in README.md.",
